3. Apply the mapping profile to the mapper.
```
var mapper = new Mapper(cfg =>
{
    cfg.AddProfile(new EntityToDTOProfile());
});
```
4. Use the mapper to map the entities to the DTOs.
```
var entities = new List<Entity>
{
    new Entity { Id = 1, Name = "Entity 1", Children = new List<Entity> { new Entity { Id = 2, Name = "Child Entity 2" } } },
    new Entity { Id = 2, Name = "Entity 2", Children = new List<Entity> { new Entity { Id = 3, Name = "Child Entity 3" } } }
};

var dtoList = mapper.Map<List<DTO>>(entities);
```
